INSERT INTO `airag_knowledge_doc` VALUES ('1897213100944261121','jeecg','2025-03-05 17:10:26','admin','2025-08-08 18:02:31','A04',NULL,'1897212906878009346','qa','text','常见question\n遇arrivequestion请先upgradeto最new version，If it is still not resolved, please give feedback to the team Click反馈question\n\n1. Building BlocksReportyesfree吗？\nanswer： Building BlocksReportcode不开源，但yesFunction可byfreemakeuse。\n\nLarge screen supports offline installation，Building BlocksBIThe launch of，可byFree forevermakeuse。\nFor corporate users we provide an enterprise version，freeVersion也meeting持续release。\n2. Function operation tips permission denied，Please contact the administrator to assign permissions！\nanswer：这yes因forReport针rightsensitiveinterface加了RoleandPermissions控制，need进OK内setRolePermissionsintegrated，具体见documentPermissionsintegratedConfiguration(important)\n\n3. Building BlocksReport怎么独立运OK？\nDockermode start\nintegratedDemostart up\n4. start up报mongomistake\nstart upReport an error：\norg.mongodb.driver.cluster : Exception in monitor thread while connecting to \nserver localhost:27017 while accessing MongoDB with Java\n\nsolution： excludemongostart updefault加载 MongoAutoConfiguration\n@SpringBootApplication\n@EnableAutoConfiguration(exclude={MongoAutoConfiguration.class})\n\n5. ReportConfigurationJeecgBootmenu\n{{ window._CONFIG[\'domianURL\'] }}/jmreport/list?token=${token}\n\nParameter description\n\n{{ window._CONFIG[\'domianURL\'] }} ：Backend project access address\n${token} ：Log intokenused forPermissions控制\nFront-end components：layouts/IframePageView menuConfigurationscreenshot\n\n\n6. Building BlocksReportdata源support哪些data库？\ndata库	support\nMySQL	√\nOracle、Oracle9i	√\nSqlServer、SqlServer2012	√\nPostgreSQL	√\nDB2、Informix	√\nMariaDB	√\nSQLite、Hsqldb、Derby、H2	√\nDameng、Renmin University of Finance and Economics、supernatural power	√\n华forhigh斯、Xu Gu、瀚highdata库、 TDengine 涛思data	√\nAlibaba CloudPolarDB、PPAS、HerdDB	√\nHive、HBase、CouchBase	√\nimportExcel、csv、jsondocumentDataset	√\nsqllite、TiDB、Doris、clickhouse、 MongoDB-BI	√\nelasticsearch、mogodb	√\nBuilding Blocks平tower暂hour只supplymysqlscript，otherdata库请自转 NavicattoolmysqlTransfer libraryoraclestep\n7. APIdata源怎样实现conditionQuery？\n具体请看Queryconditionset up\n\n8.Reportintegratedarrive自己ofspringbootproject\naskparameterlike果backtower接收of实体属性里没have，Backstage error report：not marked as ignorable\n\n\n\nSolution：Increaseapplication.ymlconfigurationjackson.fail_on_unknown_properties: false\n\n\n\n9.Building BlocksReportSQLDatasetmiddlesqlstatement加上limitexistdataPreviewmiddleReport an error?\nsqlstatement写法:\n\n Error screenshot：\n\n\n\nThe reason issqlstatement末尾加上了limit，我们existbacktower已throughdefaultPagination，So there is no need to add it at the endlimit，otherwisemeetingReport an error\n\n10.like何removePrintpageof页眉、footer？\nPrint pop-up page，Click“More settings ->Options”，remove“页眉andfooter”check mark in front，Printinterface就不show页眉andfooter了；\n\n\n\n11.Report能nointegratedarrivevueprojectmiddle?\n不能integratedarrivefront endproject，因forBuilding BlocksReportsupplyofJAVArely，只能integratedarriveJAVAprojectmiddle。\n\n12.sqlor者apiparse失败ofquestion\nsqlor者apimusthaveQuery结果才OK，不然none法parseField Relatedissue #2305\n\n13.How to customize print page settings？\nIn addition to manually selecting the printing area“A4、A3...”，还可byaccording to自己need，自definitionsize。\n\nOperation reference print area settings\n\n14.Previewhour，listarrayexistPreviewinterface怎么只show一条data？\n（1）check查existDatasetparseofhour候 ，Check or not“yesnolist”；\n\n\n\n（2）designinterface拖过来ofdataField，yesnofor#beginning；\n\n\n\n15.横向dynamicListGroup怎么design？\noperate参考document\n\n16.Previewpage多content，但designinterface没have，what to do？\nmistake样式picture：\n\n\n\nsolution： Select the extra space（You can choose more places），右键Click：deletedata，No more；\n\n\n\n17.Building BlocksReportSQLDatasetmiddledataPreviewfor什么只show10条data?\nfor了避免大dataquestion，Therefore, only take the front10条data进OKexhibition示\n\n\n\n18. Building BlocksReportdata源怎么Configuration？\nAdd todata源document\n\n19. 怎样把ReportintegratedarriveJeecgBootofmenumiddle？\nRemark：Big screenandReportofoperateyes一样of；\n\n（1）复制Report访问Link （2）in system managementmenu管理进OKConfiguration （3）ClickNewbutton填写information\n\nNotice：\na) Front-end componentsmust按照Format填写 layouts/IframePageView *usewindow._CONFIG[\'domianURL\']replaceIPaddress、end口Numberandprojectname,anduse{{}}wrap up;\nb）末尾must携带parameter，like（?sex）；\nc) yesnofor路Depend onmenu：yes；\n\n\n\n\n（4）RoleAuthorize path：in system management->RoleAuthorize找arrive自己correspondofRole,Mouse over for more->Authorize；\n\n勾选刚才创建ofmenu\n刷新page即可看见Clickmenu\n\n\n20. DatasetConfigurationClickconfirmmeetingReport an error\nhttps://github.com/jeecgboot/JimuReport/issues/439\nSQL state \\[null\\]; error code \\[0\\]; Error; nested exception is java.sql.SQLException: Error\n\nThen check it outmysqldata库even接驱动yesVersionyes5.1.47,like果yes那么请Will驱动upgradeVersionor降LowVersion，like：\n\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>mysql</groupId>\n    <artifactId>mysql-connector-java</artifactId>\n    <version>5.1.46</version>\n    <optional>true</optional>\n    <scope>runtime</scope>\n</dependency>\n\n22.like何把SQLDatasetSplicingofQuerycondition加arrivedata源grammarofgroup byFront\n参考Reportparameterset up\n\n23.Previewpage与designpage不一致，existPreviewhourAppearnull白OK\ncheck查Datasetyes多条dataofgather，还yesone条dataofobject；like果yesgathermakeuse#，like果yesobject则needmakeuse$ like果page多OKmakeuse#，则meetingquiltwhen做多indivualgather，Automatically fill in blank lines in the middle。\n\n\n\n24.for什么Configurationparameterback勾选Queryback，Turn the drop-down radio selection into an input box\nparameter不yesField，none法进OKConfigurationback就可byDown拉one选；可ConfigurationCharacter典codeImplement drop-down\n\n25.一页exhibition示一条data，Print in a loop\n可Will整页作for循环块，set upfor循环块 参考document：ClickCheck\n\n26.mysqlDatabase typetyintwas converted totrueandfalse\nneedexistdimension护interface，data源address出Splicing上\n\ntinyInt1isBit=false\n\n\n\n27.data库里pictureFieldforpictureLink