vecorrespondofsurface\n\n42.Printofhour候，font加粗效果丢失\nSong DynastyPrint不support加粗，换成defaultoffont\n\n43.sqlserverPrompt driver does not exist\nexistpomAdd to filesqlserverrely\n\n   <dependency>\n        <groupId>com.microsoft.sqlserver</groupId>\n        <artifactId>sqljdbc4</artifactId>\n        <version>4.0</version>\n        <optional>true</optional>\n        <scope>runtime</scope>\n    </dependency>     \n\n44.sqlserverDownmakeuseCONVERT函数Notice事item\nIncompatibleorder by一起makeuse\nCONVERTThe function needs to specify an alias like：CONVERT(varchar(7),CREATE_TIME) as CREATE_TIME\n45.能noset up隐藏ofQuerycondition\nquestiondescribe： 同一Report，希望不同ofpeople看arrive不同ofdata，目forwardcan passJSEnhanceset up初始value，但又不想让use户修change，能nosupplyset upQuerycondition隐藏ofFunction，这样便于dataPermissionsof控制。 Analysis instructions：此question目ofexist于不同ofpeople看不同ofdata，提问people想set upQueryconditiondefaultvalue且不allow修change\n\n1.不同ofpeople看不同ofdata：可bymakeusesystem变量 参考document like：\n\nsqlDataset：select * from demo where create_by = \'#{sysUserCode}\'\napiDataset： http://xxx.xxx.xxx/query?create_by=#{sysUserCode}\n\nNotice：Here `sysUserCode`,yessystemdefaultset upofLog inpeopleof账Number，like果重写getUserInfomethod则need重新set up，documentincode，只适used forjeecg-bootNot to be copied，For reference only【Recommend this solution】。\n\n\n2.想set upQueryconditiondefaultvalue且不allow修change: jsEnhance可byset upQueryconditionofdefaultvalue，也可by往Queryparameterobject里set up一indivual自definitionofparametervalue，这indivualyessupportof。但yes，existConfigurationDatasetofhour候，belowtabReportField明细andReportparametermiddle，meetingConfiguration一些Fieldinformation，like果jsEnhancedefinitionofparameter名不exist这两indivualtabDown，那么none效！所by做法likeDown：\ndefinitionDataset（不needWillparameternameset upforQuerycondition）：\nsqlDataset：select * from demo where create_by = \'${name}\'\napiDataset： http://xxx.xxx.xxx/query?create_by=${name}\n\ndefinitionjsEnhance,set upnamevalue：\nfunction init(){\n    this.queryInfo[\'name\'] = \'scott\'\n}\n\n46. datedefaultQuery，none法set updefaultvaluefor上moon\nquestiondescribe： makeusedateStr default取上moon实现不了，use=concat(dateStr(\'yyyy\'),\'-\', dateStr(\'MM\', -1))return2021-9，不yes2021-09，One person missing。 Recommended implementation=dateStr(\'yyyy-MM\'，-1) return 2021-09，而不yesmakeusesky数计算偏移量。\nsolution： 参考document inupgradeFunction\n\n47. Print an extra page of blank paper\nsolution： PrintExport，null白OKand没haveOKyeshavedistrict别of，interface上都yesnull白没district别，但yes实际data存储，Blank lines will take up space。\nCheck控制towerPrintofdata：yourrowsDudoda90Too many lines，illustrateyes之forward你designof很多historydata没havedeleteOK，resulting in many more blank pages。\n\n\n\n48. mongodbuse法\n1). byAuthorizeofmode startMongo,给makeuseofdata库Add touse户\n\nswitchdata库 use test\n\n创建use户 db.createUser({user: \"root\", pwd: \"123456\", roles: \\[{ role: \"dbOwner\", db: \"test\" }\\]})\n\nReference blog：https://www.cnblogs.com/jacksoft/p/6916137.html\n\n2). mongodb-driver-sync 驱动integrateduse法 Reference blog： https://blog.csdn.net/nyzzht123/article/details/107936552 https://www.jianshu.com/p/5186fb5a1292\n\n49、Appearjsqlparser不compatiblequestion\nlike果Appearjsqlparser不compatiblequestion，请这么Quote\n<dependency>\n  <groupId>org.jeecgframework.jimureport</groupId>\n  <artifactId>jimureport-spring-boot-starter</artifactId>\n  <version>{VersionNumber}</version>\n  <exclusions>\n    <exclusion>\n      <artifactId>minidao-spring-boot-starter</artifactId>\n      <groupId>org.jeecgframework</groupId>\n    </exclusion>\n  </exclusions>\n</dependency>\n<dependency>\n  <groupId>org.jeecgframework</groupId>\n  <artifactId>minidao-spring-boot-starter</artifactId>\n  <version>1.8.8</version>\n</dependency>\n\n50、aboutBuilding BlocksReportexistdevelop、Incremental synchronization of production environmenthttps://github.com/jeecgboot/JimuReport/issues/1928\n51、data库Fieldforkeywords，Field作forQueryconditionReport an error\nError message：DiscovermysqlDownkeywordsField\"year_month\"Lack\"`\"\n\nSELECT COUNT(1) total FROM ( select * from (select `year_month`,name,age from `demo`) jeecg_rp_temp  where year_month=? ) temp_count\n\n\nsolution：keywordsField请useas重命名一Down\n\n\n\n52、relyredissonbackeditCharacter典、QueryCharacter典Report an error：\nError message：\n\njava.lang.IllegalArgumentException: Cannot find cache named \'jmreport:cache:dict\' for Builder\n\nSolution：ConfigurationdocumentIncrease：\n\nspring:\n  cache:\n    type: redis\n\n53、未Log inof情况DownExportexcelandpdfReport an error\nsolution：existSpringSecurityConfigpageexcludeExportexcelandExportpdfofaskaddress，Others are the same\n\n\n\n .antMatchers(\"/jmreport/exportPdfStream\", \"/jmreport/exportAllExcelStream\")','failed','{\"failedReason\":\"Failed to execute \'init\'\"}'),('1897926864815575042','jeecg','2025-03-07 16:26:41','admin','2025-08-08 18:02:29','A04',NULL,'1897926563148648449','index','file','\n# projectintroduce\n\n\n `JeecgBoot` yes一款based oncodegenerate器of`Low-code development platform` Have zero code capabilities！采useforwardrear endpoint离架构：SpringBoot2.x，Ant Design&Vue，Mybatis-plus，Shiro，JWT。强大ofcodegenerate器让forwardrear endcode一键generate，none需写任何code! JeecgBootLeading new development models(Online Codingmodel-> codegenerate器model-> manualMERGEIntelligent development)， Help solveJavaproject70%repetitive work，Let developers focus more on business logic。It can quickly improve development efficiency，Help companies save costs，同hour又不失灵活性！JeecgBoot还独创onlinedevelopmodel（No-Codeconcept）：onlinesurfaceoneConfiguration（surfaceonedesign器）、Mobile configuration capabilities、WorkflowConfiguration（onlinedesignprocess）、ReportConfigurationability、onlinechartConfiguration、Plug-in capabilities（pluggable）etc.！\n\n `JeecgBootexist提highUIability`of同hour，Reduced development costs for front and rear separation，JeecgBoot还独创onlinedevelopmodel（No-Codeconcept），一seriesonlineIntelligent development：onlineConfiguration form、onlineConfigurationReport、onlinechartdesign、onlinedesignprocessetc.。\n\n ` JEECG宗旨yes: `Simple function consists ofOnline CodingConfiguration implementation（onlineConfiguration form、onlineConfigurationReport、onlinechartdesign、onlinedesignprocess、onlinedesignsurfaceone），complexFunctionDepend oncodegenerate器generate进OKmanualMerge，It not only ensures intelligence but also takes into account flexibility.; \n\n businessprocess采useWorkflow来实现、Expand出Taskinterface，For developers to write business logic，surfaceonesupply多种solution： surfaceonedesign器、onlineConfiguration form、coding form。同hour实现了process与surfaceoneofpoint离design（loose coupling）、andsupportTasknode灵活Configuration，既保证了companyprocessof保密性，It also reduces the workload of developers。\n\n\n## technologysupport\n\n*  Beginner Guide： [Quick start](http://www.jeecg.com/doc/quickstart)   |   [常见question ](http://www.jeecg.com/doc/qa)  | [version log](http://jeecg.com/doc/log)\n*  Video tutorial：[ JeecgBoot v3.7 new versionVideo tutorial](http://jeecg.com/doc/video)\n*  QQCommunication group：⑩716488839、⑨808791225(Full)、other(Full)\n*  onlineDemo ：  [System demonstration](http://boot3.jeecg.com)   |  [APPDemo](http://app.jeecg.com)\n\n\n源码Down载\n-----------------------------------\n\n- https://github.com/jeecgboot/jeecg-boot\n\n\n\n## Technical architecture\n-----------------------------------\n\n#### rear end\n\n- IDEsuggestion： IDEA (must安装lombokplug-in )\n- language：Java 8+ (support17)\n- rely管理：Maven\n- basic framework：Spring Boot 2.7.18\n- Microservices framework： Spring Cloud Alibaba 2021.0.1.0\n- Persistence layer framework：MybatisPlus 3.5.3.2\n- Reporttool： JimuReport 1.7.6\n- security framework：Apache Shiro 1.12.0，Jwt 3.11.0\n- Microservice technology stack：Spring Cloud Alibaba、Nacos、Gateway、Sentinel、Skywalking\n- data库even接池：AlibabaDruid 1.1.22\n- Log printing：logback\n- cache：Redis\n- other：autopoi, fastjson，poi，Swagger-ui，quartz, lombok（Simplify the code）wait。\n- defaultdata库script：MySQL5.7+\n- [otherdata库，Need to transfer it yourself](https://my.oschina.net/jeecg/blog/4905722)\n\n\n#### front end\n\n- front endIDEsuggestion：WebStorm、Vscode\n- 采use Vue3.0+TypeScript+Vite+Ant-Design-Vuewait新technology方案，Includes secondary packaging components、utils、hooks、dynamicmenu、Permission verification、buttonlevelPermissions控制waitFunction\n- Latest technology stack：Vue3.0 + TypeScript + Vite5 + ant-design-vue4 + pinia + echarts + unocss + vxe-table + qiankun + es6\n- rely管理：node、npm、pnpm\n\n\n\n#### support库\n\n|  data库   |  support   |\n| --- | --- |\n|   MySQL   |  √   |\n|  Oracle11g   |  √   |\n|  Sqlserver2017   |  √   |\n|   PostgreSQL   |  √   |\n|   MariaDB   |  √   |\n|   Dameng   |  √   |\n|   Renmin University of Finance and Economics   |  √   |\n\n\n\n## 微Servesolution\n\n\n- 1、Serve注册andDiscover Nacos √\n- 2、Unified configuration center Nacos  √\n- 3、routing gateway gateway(Three loading methods) √\n- 4、distributed http feign √\n- 5、circuit breaker, degraded current limiting Sentinel √\n- 6、distributeddocument Minio、AliOSS √ \n- 7、Unified permission control JWT + Shiro √\n- 8、Service monitoring SpringBootAdmin√\n- 9、link tracking Skywalking   [参考document](/java/springcloud/super/skywarking)\n- 10、Message middleware RabbitMQ  √\n- 11、distributedTask xxl-job  √ \n- 12、distributed事务 Seata\n- 13、轻量distributedday志 Loki+grafanakit\n- 14、support docker-compose、k8s、jenkins\n- 15、CAS one点Log in   √\n- 16、Routing current limit   √\n\n   \n### Microservice architecture diagram\n![Microservice architecture diagram](https://jeecgos.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/files/jeecgboot_springcloud2022.png \"exist这里enterpicturetitle\")\n\n\n\n\n\n## System architecture diagram\n\n![](https://upload.jeecg.com/jeecg/help/jeecgback/images/screenshot_1662547398792.png)\n*****\n\n\n## System screenshot\n\n### PCend\n\n![](https://upload.jeecg.com/jeecg/help/jeecgback/topwrite/assets/image_1687778397612.png)\n\n![](https://upload.jeecg.com/jeecg/help/jeecgback/topwrite/assets/image_1687778435846.png)\n\n![](https://upload.jeecg.com/jeecg/help/jeecgback/topwrite/assets/image_1687778476447.png)\n\n![](